      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Paquita and Magüi are dressing up for the country wedding of Paquita's ex-husband Paco. Magüi feels shy in her borrowed red cocktail dress, so Paquita cheers her up and suggests taking a photo make Magüi's ex jealous. Listen to the Spanish first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Venga, Magüi, que no eres la novia.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Seguro que estás guapísima. Sal.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "magui",
      "t": "Ya voy.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "¿Qué pasa? A ver, mírame.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
