      "t": "Venga, Magüi, que no eres la novia.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Come on, Magüi, you're not the bride.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "Seguro que estás guapísima. Sal.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'm sure you look gorgeous. Come out.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "magui",
      "t": "Ya voy.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'm coming.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "paquita",
      "t": "¿Qué pasa? A ver, mírame.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What's wrong? Let's see, look at me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
